OL,3,AVanessa Trump says she is cancer-free
OL,4,Asix months after revealing diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FVanessa Trump, the former wife of
OL,7,FDonald Trump Jr, has announced that she
OL,8,Fis cancer-free following her breast
OL,9,Fcancer diagnosis earlier this year.
OL,11,FTrump, 48, who has five children with
OL,12,FUS President Donald Trump's eldest son,
OL,13,Fsaid that her recent tests results
OL,14,F"came back clear, so I'm finally
OL,15,Fcancer-free", in a short video on her
OL,16,F19-year-old daughter Kai's Instagram
OL,17,Faccount.
OL,19,FVanessa and Kai Trump then released a
OL,20,Flonger video on Saturday, in which they
OL,21,Fdiscussed breast cancer awareness,
OL,22,Fearly detection and prevention.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
